Html":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527671485,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33522},{"id":1787542992537,"text":"用心去感受你自己的手指，而不是网络延迟。","rawContent":"用心去感受你自己的手指，而不是网络延迟。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527671486,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33523},{"id":1787542992538,"text":"告诉我，指肚往下按的时候，那颗小豆子是不是比刚才硬了一点？","rawContent":"告诉我，指肚往下按的时候，那颗小豆子是不是比刚才硬了一点？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527673280,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33524},{"id":1787542992539,"text":"有一点","sender":"me","time":"07:28","timestamp":1787527717013,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33525},{"id":1787542992541,"text":"既然硬了，就别光在周围打转。","rawContent":"既然硬了，就别光在周围打转。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:29","timestamp":1787527747181,"roundId":"round_1787527719105_i78hf2ta1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33526},{"id":1787542992542,"text":"指腹直接按上去。","rawContent":"指腹直接按上去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:29","timestamp":1787527747317,"roundId":"round_1787527719105_i78hf2ta1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33527},{"id":1787542992543,"text":"刚压上去那一下肯定会酸得打颤，别往后缩，手给我稳住。","rawContent":"刚压上去那一下肯定会酸得打颤，别往后缩，手给我稳